# register. The skipped-macroblock count, the refresh rate of the Sofdec timer,
# the player handle of the supply check and the size for the ADX header decoder
# are passed as the callees read them; two forwarding functions return the
# result their callers use (found by comparing every declaration of the CRI
# units with its definition in LLVM IR, see the status file).
